Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:03:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add paste-use (Pastyx clipboard history) to the
 use-family bundle

use-family 0.7.0 -> 0.8.0: paste-use joins the marketplace, the bundle's
dependencies, both family installers (macOS and Windows; there is no Linux
Pastyx), the upgrader, the session-start doctor and the CLI version sync.
Routing skill: a new "What I copied" layer, and a pick-by-target line for
things the user copied.
